# INVWINMP.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the Record menu
# as a pop-up menu, and the File menu.  At level 3 SHIFT-F10 on the item
# list opens the pop-up at the selected row, which ESC closes, after
# which F10 alone opens the menu bar as ever (DOWN drops File); a letter
# chooses an entry and does what its key does: E (Edit...) item 2's form
# in edit mode, which ESC leaves, M (Move...) its move dialog.  Items >
# Browse by maker moves the check mark to its entry; Assemblies, empty,
# shows none, and its pop-up has Open, Edit and Delete grayed and New
# not; ESC closes it and opens the item list as a login does, Browse by
# ID checked.  On the location tree the pop-up's M moves Office; ESC
# opens the item list so again.  File > Log out shows the login dialog,
# where a reader logs in: the pop-up's entries that change records are
# grayed, E gives nothing and P shows
# item 1's parts, ESC back.  The end by File > Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINMP.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/menuchk.py checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S ITEMS
K SHIFT-F10
S POPUP
K ESC
S CLOSED
K SHIFT-F10 ESC F10 DOWN
S F10MENU
K ESC ESC
K DOWN SHIFT-F10 E
S EDIT
K ESC
S EDITBACK
K SHIFT-F10 M
S MOVE
K ESC ALT-I M
S MAKER
K ALT-I A
S ASSY
K SHIFT-F10
S ASSYPOP
K ESC ESC
S ASSYBACK
K ALT-L B
S LOCS
K SHIFT-F10
S TREEPOP
K M
S TREEMOVE
K ESC ESC
S LISTBACK
K ALT-F L STAB
S LOGOUT
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER
S READER
K SHIFT-F10
S RPOPUP
K E
S NOEDIT
K SHIFT-F10 P
S PARTS
K ESC
S PARTBACK
K ALT-F X
S GONE
